"],"linesEn":["Don't worry, leave this to me."]}],[{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,1104,559,370,401,404,307,745,776,881,367,390,896],[181,672,65,647,462,608,127,1031,629,396,180],[181,1079,559,339,559,913,1022,1023,462,678,127,128,370]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『殿下，以您王國公主的身份","　怎可和這些盜匪為伍？","　陛下已下令逮捕這幫盜賊，"],"linesZhCn":["『殿下，以您王国公主的身份","　怎可和这些盗匪为伍？","　陛下已下令逮捕这帮盗贼，"],"linesEn":["Your Highness, as a princess of the realm,","how can you consort with these bandits?","His Majesty has ordered their arrest."]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,725,724,559,408,580,1104,559,310,1118,370,462,608],[181,127,1031,376,468,919,150,361,717,271,345,65,401],[181,341,581,560]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["　讓屬下迎接殿下回宮，這些","　盜匪交給禁衛軍處理就可以","　了。』"],"linesZhCn":["　让属下迎接殿下回宫，这些","　盗匪交给禁卫军处理就可以","　了。』"],"linesEn":["Allow me to escort you back to the palace.","The Royal Guard will handle these brigands."]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,48,49,370,568,486,861,401,629,605,343,463,1126],[181,1074,98,370,640,300,293,605,693,346,791,792,568],[181,338,180,606,607,378,462,608,919,150,361,1127,806]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『萊汀，我一直以為你是個聰","　明人，難道連你也不相信我","　嗎？趕快把這些禁衛軍撤走"],"linesZhCn":["『莱汀，我一直以为你是个聪","　明人，难道连你也不相信我","　吗？赶快把这些禁卫军撤走"],"linesEn":["Raiden, I took you for a sensible man.","Do you really doubt me as well?","Stand down the Royal Guard at once!"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[181,568,334,380,788,1117,307,370,378,536,816,534,463],[181,822,823,581,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["　我要去見父王，把事情說個","　清楚。』"],"linesZhCn":["　我要去见父王，把事情说个","　清楚。』"],"linesEn":["I must see Father","and clear all this up."]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,776,881,1104,559,370,1079,559,400,913,395,199,370],[181,378,462,678,1031,1032,600,600,1021,381,579,313,534],[181,370,697,437,404,465,343,334,194,690,175,569,367]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『公主殿下，陛下有令在先，","　把這幫匪徒通通抓起來再說","　，如果您還是要護著他們的"],"linesZhCn":["『公主殿下，陛下有令在先，","　把这帮匪徒通通抓起来再说","　，如果您还是要护着他们的"],"linesEn":["Princess, His Majesty's orders were clear:","apprehend these outlaws first. If you","continue to shield them..."]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,652,370,151,724,559,345,386,1073,341,581,560]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["　話，那屬下就得罪了。』"],"linesZhCn":["　话，那属下就得罪了。』"],"linesEn":["...then forgive my insolence."]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,48,49,370,605,767,716,568,368,118,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『萊汀，你敢對我動手！』"],"linesZhCn":["『莱汀，你敢对我动手！』"],"linesEn":["Raiden, you dare draw your blade against me?!"]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,776,881,1104,559,370],[181,350,508,1080,724,559,367,306,1097,581]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『公主殿下，","　請原諒屬下的無禮。"],"linesZhCn":["『公主殿下，","　请原谅属下的无礼。"],"linesEn":["Princess, please forgive my insolence."]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,579,98,370,378,462,611,127,1031,634,468,568,1021],[181,381,579,342,560]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["　來人，把這群盜匪都給我抓","　起來！』"],"linesZhCn":["　来人，把这群盗匪都给我抓","　起来！』"],"linesEn":["Men! Seize these bandits at once!"]}],[{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,1128,584,776,881,1104,559,370,404,629,893,584],[181,629,893,334,466,462,608,98,579,434,965],[181,1079,559,584,584,560]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『唔…公主殿下，您為何…","　為何要帶這些人來加害","　陛下……』"],"linesZhCn":["『唔…公主殿下，您为何…","　为何要带这些人来加害","　陛下……』"],"linesEn":["Ugh... Princess, why...","Why would you bring these people","to harm His Majesty...?"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,48,49,370,568,672,344,458,659,334,434,965],[181,1117,307,342,1118,331,387,664,363,258,341],[181,411,344,536,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『萊汀，我怎麼會想要加害","　父王！宮中到底發生了","　什麼事？』"],"linesZhCn":["『莱汀，我怎么会想要加害","　父王！宫中到底发生了","　什么事？』"],"linesEn":["Raiden, why would I ever harm Father?!","What on earth has happened in the palace?!"]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,584,493,694,266,400,195,668,285,952,1079,559,367],[181,1129,1118,370,659,334,1021,806,1079,559,370,1130,369],[181,373,138,698,1131,368,341,1132,150,370]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『…前幾天有刺客夜襲陛下的","　寢宮，想要抓走陛下，幸好","　打鬥聲驚動了侍衛，"],"linesZhCn":["『…前几天有刺客夜袭陛下的","　寝宫，想要抓走陛下，幸好","　打斗声惊动了侍卫，"],"linesEn":["...A few nights ago, assassins raided","His Majesty's chambers to abduct him.","Thankfully, the clash alerted the guards,"]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,150,94,236,364,579,850,1133,370,1079,559,755,1134],[181,985,1135,640,584,560]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["　衛兵衝進來救駕，陛下才倖","　免於難…』"],"linesZhCn":["　卫兵冲进来救驾，陛下才幸","　免于难…』"],"linesEn":["who rushed in to defend him,","saving His Majesty's life..."]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,400,462,719,536,180,342,534,559,380,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『有這種事？！說下去！』"],"linesZhCn":["『有这种事？！说下去！』"],"linesEn":["Such a thing happened?!","Go on!"]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,195,668,409,806,493,465,1136,1137,370],[181,694,266,132,432,486,360,458,313,579,584,584],[181,1079,559,971,387,462,719,1131,1084,370]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『刺客臨走前還揚言，","　幾天之內一定會再來……","　陛下遭到這種驚嚇，"],"linesZhCn":["『刺客临走前还扬言，","　几天之内一定会再来……","　陛下遭到这种惊吓，"],"linesEn":["Before fleeing, the assassins vowed","they would return within days...","Shaken by the ordeal,"]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,694,266,579,486,861,395,1138,391,356,1069,584,560]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["　幾天來一直在床上休養…』"],"linesZhCn":["　几天来一直在床上休养…』"],"linesEn":["His Majesty has been bedridden ever since..."]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,462,272,536,712,629,893,458,752,387,568,569],[181,390,391,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"索爾","speakerGlyphs":[36,37],"portraitId":0,"linesZhTw":["『這件事又為何會扯到我們","　身上？』"],"linesZhCn":["『这件事又为何会扯到我们","　身上？』"],"linesEn":["And how does any of that","get pinned on us?"]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,629,341,1139,1040,65,1140,896,291,370,568,569,395],[181,307,745,750,114,1020,455,1039,1040,140,370,365,437],[181,712,363,371,341,346,447,155,536,370,1141,697,494]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『為了搜查可疑份子，我們在","　王國各地派出調查隊，結果","　又發現了不少怪事，例如普"],"linesZhCn":["『为了搜查可疑份子，我们在","　王国各地派出调查队，结果","　又发现了不少怪事，例如普"],"linesEn":["To root out suspicious agents, we sent search","parties across the realm. They uncovered many","strange occurrences, such as..."]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,80,495,496,367,439,1044,536,272,370,623,605,569],[181,712,1142,391,341,1039,1040,140,370,365,437,584,560]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["　里茲港的失蹤事件，而你們","　又惹上了調查隊，結果…』"],"linesZhCn":["　里兹港的失踪事件，而你们","　又惹上了调查队，结果…』"],"linesEn":["...the disappearances at Port Pritz.","Then you crossed swords with the search party,","and as a result..."]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,125,1143,569,486,980,910,629,568,569,345,343,195],[181,668,180,462,797,1144,1145,341,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『大臣們一致認為我們就是刺","　客？這太荒謬了！』"],"linesZhCn":["『大臣们一致认为我们就是刺","　客？这太荒谬了！』"],"linesEn":["The ministers concluded we are the assassins?!","That is utterly absurd!"]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,915,44,125,98,791,721,603,1146,462,719,534,81],[181,628,401,259,913,568,569,919,150,361,1020,94,435],[181,113,605,569,584,584,560]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『葛雷大人相當支持這種說法","　所以命令我們禁衛軍派兵攻","　擊你們……』"],"linesZhCn":["『葛雷大人相当支持这种说法","　所以命令我们禁卫军派兵攻","　击你们……』"],"linesEn":["Lord Gray strongly pushed for that conclusion,","ordering the Royal Guard to strike you down..."]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,346,343,1117,307,559,913,367,338,180,672,344,712],[181,1116,542,915,44,341,180,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『不是父王下令的嗎？怎麼又","　變成葛雷了？』"],"linesZhCn":["『不是父王下令的吗？怎么又","　变成葛雷了？』"],"linesEn":["I thought this was Father's decree!","Why is Lord Gray calling the shots?"]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,1079,559,70,771,579,486,861,1147,986,395,1138,370],[181,361,913,524,651,634,343,449,429,915,44,125,98],[181,363,1148,584,560]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『陛下多日來一直臥病在床，","　軍令方面都是經由葛雷大人","　發佈…』"],"linesZhCn":["『陛下多日来一直卧病在床，","　军令方面都是经由葛雷大人","　发布…』"],"linesEn":["His Majesty has been bedridden for days.","All military directives have been issued","through Lord Gray..."]}],[{"speaker":83,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,919,150,361,140,141,48,49,370,659,346,387,605],[181,592,767,647,127,1031,1149,365,370,568,569,631,915],[181,44,125,98,132,259,1150,605,1022,1023,342]],"speakerSlot":34,"speakerNameZh":"突擊騎兵","speakerGlyphs":[112,113,95,94],"portraitId":83,"linesZhTw":["『禁衛軍隊長萊汀，想不到你","　竟敢和盜匪勾結，我們奉葛","　雷大人之命將你逮捕！"],"linesZhCn":["『禁卫军队长莱汀，想不到你","　竟敢和盗匪勾结，我们奉葛","　雷大人之命将你逮捕！"],"linesEn":["Captain Raiden of the Royal Guard!","To think you would conspire with bandits!","By order of Lord Gray, you are under arrest!"]},{"speaker":83,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[181,606,607,146,118,345,1019,358,342,560]],"speakerSlot":34,"speakerNameZh":"突擊騎兵","speakerGlyphs":[112,113,95,94],"portraitId":83,"linesZhTw":["　趕快束手就擒吧！』"],"linesZhCn":["　赶快束手就擒吧！』"],"linesEn":["Surrender without resistance!"]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,65,102,370,568,1074,257,341,370,915,44,462,463],[181,671,515,367,1151,1032,584,584,560]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『可惡，我明白了，葛雷這個","　該死的叛徒……』"],"linesZhCn":["『可恶，我明白了，葛雷这个","　该死的叛徒……』"],"linesEn":["Damn it... I see it now.","Gray, that treacherous dog...!"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,48,49,370,834,462,696,658,579,370,1117,307,717],[181,1038,799,894,370,568,569,199,883,81,135,364,380],[181,313,534,342,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『萊汀，照這樣看來，父王處","　境危險，我們先設法殺進去","　再說！』"],"linesZhCn":["『莱汀，照这样看来，父王处","　境危险，我们先设法杀进去","　再说！』"],"linesEn":["Raiden, Father must be in grave danger!","We need to fight our way inside!"]},{"speaker":118,"boxPos":"top","lines":[[557,1104,559,370,724,559,340,1152,98,628,1153,370],[181,400,897,653,194,1079,559,367,424,259,370],[181,350,725,724,559,647,605,569,486,381,380,342,560]],"speakerSlot":11,"speakerNameZh":"萊汀","speakerGlyphs":[48,49],"portraitId":118,"linesZhTw":["『殿下，屬下被奸人所騙，","　有負保護陛下的使命，","　請讓屬下和你們一起去！』"],"linesZhCn":["『殿下，属下被奸人所骗，","　有负保护陛下的使命，","　请让属下和你们一起去！』"],"linesEn":["Princess, I was blinded by deceit and failed","my sacred duty. Please, allow me to join you!"]},{"speaker":8,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,605,642,682,462,344,296,370,465,343,199,584,584],[181,560]],"speakerNameZh":"希莉亞","speakerGlyphs":[51,52,43],"portraitId":8,"linesZhTw":["『你受傷這麼重，還是先……","　』"],"linesZhCn":["『你受伤这么重，还是先……","　』"],"linesEn":["You're wounded so badly,","you should first..."]},{"speaker":0,"boxPos":"bottom","lines":[[557,644,342,51,52,43,370,371,395,816,337,687,997],[181,568,658,462,612,609,908,428,373,367,370,614,55],[181,56,689,81,136,468,175,416,486,559,